 "business": {
  "text": "Our Company is primarily engaged in providing solar energy solutions, comprising engineering, procurement and construction (“EPC”) services for solar projects, including the installation and commissioning of solar power systems, and operation and maintenance (\"O&M\") services. Our operations are organised into three service verticals: (i) EPC services, which are further subdivided into ground mounted solar projects and rooftop solar projects; (ii) O&M services; and (iii) independent power producer (“IPP”).",
